<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 69.9554 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 69.9554 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 69.9554 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 69.8282 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 18		  Oct 17</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     69.9554		 69.8282</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  3.470		   1.180</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 45.4771		 45.7073</p>
<p> volume (DM million)		 0.120		   0.055</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
